{"3538180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Foxo", "steam_appid": 3538180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Welcome to Foxo</strong>, a cozy multiplayer world! Connect with friends, play minigames, fish, decorate, find treasure, and collect clothes, furniture, pets and upgrade your den. Relax, hang out, and make new friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦊 <strong>Customize your Fox!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique fox with a wide range of clothes, accessories, and colors to express your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d8625c1abd05ceb427617c9e50807de4.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d8625c1abd05ceb427617c9e50807de4.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👯 <strong>Play with Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out in shared spaces, visit each others dens, meet new players, find hidden treasures, play minigames, and catch fish together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/584d4e13b875395708f6bbbf1ff1c57f.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/584d4e13b875395708f6bbbf1ff1c57f.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎣 <strong>Play Minigames!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking to relax or compete, there’s always something fun to play: fishing, treasure hunts, downhill racing, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d9d408500acdb59782ce89e5e1e8ec19.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d9d408500acdb59782ce89e5e1e8ec19.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏡 Decorate and Upgrade Your Den!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cozy starter room to a multi-room sanctuary, collect furniture, unlock styles, and turn your den into a true home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/46070012d64a2a0a791937ce77a90211.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/46070012d64a2a0a791937ce77a90211.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 <strong>Collect Pets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, collect, and care for a variety of adorable pets that will join you when you're out and about. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/bb1e7f0cb528d1b5d7caef582bfcb6f7.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/bb1e7f0cb528d1b5d7caef582bfcb6f7.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy online world where everyone is a fox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable fox characters with tons of clothes and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open social spaces plus private dens to decorate and invite friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative, competitive and solo minigames: fishing, racing, treasure hunts, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and care for cute companion pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for casual fun, relaxing vibes, and meaningful social play</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Welcome to Foxo</strong>, a cozy multiplayer world! Connect with friends, play minigames, fish, decorate, find treasure, and collect clothes, furniture, pets and upgrade your den. Relax, hang out, and make new friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦊 <strong>Customize your Fox!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique fox with a wide range of clothes, accessories, and colors to express your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d8625c1abd05ceb427617c9e50807de4.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d8625c1abd05ceb427617c9e50807de4.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👯 <strong>Play with Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out in shared spaces, visit each others dens, meet new players, find hidden treasures, play minigames, and catch fish together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/584d4e13b875395708f6bbbf1ff1c57f.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/584d4e13b875395708f6bbbf1ff1c57f.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎣 <strong>Play Minigames!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking to relax or compete, there’s always something fun to play: fishing, treasure hunts, downhill racing, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d9d408500acdb59782ce89e5e1e8ec19.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/d9d408500acdb59782ce89e5e1e8ec19.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏡 Decorate and Upgrade Your Den!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cozy starter room to a multi-room sanctuary, collect furniture, unlock styles, and turn your den into a true home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/46070012d64a2a0a791937ce77a90211.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/46070012d64a2a0a791937ce77a90211.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 <strong>Collect Pets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, collect, and care for a variety of adorable pets that will join you when you're out and about. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/bb1e7f0cb528d1b5d7caef582bfcb6f7.poster.avif?t=1754058928\" width=605 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/extras/bb1e7f0cb528d1b5d7caef582bfcb6f7.webm?t=1754058928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy online world where everyone is a fox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable fox characters with tons of clothes and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open social spaces plus private dens to decorate and invite friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative, competitive and solo minigames: fishing, racing, treasure hunts, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and care for cute companion pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for casual fun, relaxing vibes, and meaningful social play</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Foxo is a cozy online hangout: play minigames, go fishing, decorate/ expand your room and express yourself with tons of customization options, all with one crucial twist... everyone is a fox!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/b0c19d609c1b4a138641642cd1dfd7cc01598fb9/header.jpg?t=1754058928", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538180/87ae16ffa812890579da616727bf8e04eafc06